    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I see math as a tool for understanding patterns and solving real-world problems. My interest grew through chemistry, where equations model molecular interactions. I’m not a math expert but appreciate how it connects to practical applications like physics and data analysis. It’s challenging but rewarding.",
